Production-grade UI pass: icon system, app shell, report integrity

- AppIcon: inline stroke SVG icon set (no emoji/unicode glyphs, no icon
  font/CDN dependency); replaced every emoji across the app, including
  mojibake section headings that had corrupted encoding
- Slim 56px app shell: brand mark, single rolled-up system status dot
  (operational/degraded/offline), divider, SVG theme toggle
- Hero: micro-label + headline replaces numbered-circle gimmick; shared
  .btn system with focus rings; refined chips and inline validation
- Runs sidebar: search filter, All/Done/Failed status tabs, skeleton
  loading rows, count badge
- Pipeline: overall progress bar, mono stage indices, SVG state glyphs
- Report rebuilt on current data model (scorecard, valuation, earnings
  quality, insider activity, management questions all preserved):
  fixed undefined legacy CSS variables, serif editorial masthead with
  Summary/Detailed toggle, verdict cards, grouped metrics table with
  gold group headers, theme-safe tone classes for score/recommendation
  pills, red-flag bands, 72ch measure caps, print stylesheet
- Theme correctness: :host-context() for dark selectors inside scoped
  component styles; removed background transitions that froze repaints
  on ancestor variable swaps in Chromium
- Zero-warning production build; skeletons for report loading

